            "notes": "## Recommend\n* [Omni-Boost](item_632bd990-4523-4b3f-b08a-6dd11280c6f9)\n**If you do not have enough credits, prioritize this one!**\nThe Shield-Bash Distance is insanely good and u can use it in almost every situation!\n\n* [Nullifier Neuroworks](item_6501be99-b951-4dad-9bb5-8305eb17d84e)\nThis Item is like the Perk, that Brigitte got for Default Games. It has insane value and u can support your tank and dps really good!\n\n## Optional\n*  [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) \nUse this if you have many effects. For example  [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1) [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54)  [Mei](hero_36fd67f0-19df-4c50-add9-709cfb147cb0) etc.\n\n* [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) \nThis is great to have more survivability! \n\n\nFill up with greens if you have enough money",
