            "notes": "# Power\nNow choose the other missing power. Either [Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753) or [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3), depending on the power you chose first.\n\n\n\n# Items\n## Recommend\n* [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) \nThis item has really good value! You get 15% more damage on your Flail and you get insane movement speed and 5% heal of your life in addition to your Inspire!\n\n## Optional\n* [Hardlight Weave](item_0e674b2f-4048-4fc9-be6d-95d51d2ae33b) \nChoose this if you want to be more tanky. This gives you the opportunity to survive longer if the enemy team has a lot of damage. \n* [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) \nIf you want a shield with even more health, choose this item.\n\n\nFill up with  [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and greens",
